        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Passage Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Narrow Escutcheon Plate Passage Function Lever (Entrance by lever, always unlocked.) is suitable for all Narrow or Wide Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-narrow-stile-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6400r\"><b>6400 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/narrow-stile-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-6400v\"><b>6400 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-n-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for 6300/6400 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-n-09-phl\"><b>Storeroom Function Lever for 6300/6400 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and instructions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-N-14-PHL Passage Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Passage Function (ANSI F14) - Entrance by lever, always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6-n-temp.pdf?v=1718159615\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6-N Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6W6N6T-Installation.pdf?v=1718159616\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
